{"id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-jump.md","title":"Turing 跳跃与有限迭代","display":"df-jump — Turing 跳跃与有限迭代","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-jump","aliases":["20-df-jump"],"display":"df-jump — Turing 跳跃与有限迭代","chapter":"3","section":"3.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 3.4.2","source_pdf_pages":[97],"source_printed_pages":[61],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-deg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jump — Turing 跳跃与有限迭代"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.4.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>97</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>61</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA&#39;:=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\\},\\qquad A^{(0)}:=A,\\quad A^{(n+1)}:=(A^{(n)})&#39;,\\\\\n\\mathbf a&#39;:=\\deg_T(A&#39;)\\quad(A\\in\\mathbf a),\\qquad\n\\mathbf a^{(0)}:=\\mathbf a,\\quad\\mathbf a^{(n+1)}:=(\\mathbf a^{(n)})&#39;.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA&#39;:=\\{e\\in\\omega:\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\\},\\qquad A^{(0)}:=A,\\quad A^{(n+1)}:=(A^{(n)})&#39;,\\\\\n\\mathbf a&#39;:=\\deg_T(A&#39;)\\quad(A\\in\\mathbf a),\\qquad\n\\mathbf a^{(0)}:=\\mathbf a,\\quad\\mathbf a^{(n+1)}:=(\\mathbf a^{(n)})&#39;.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X&#39;:=\\{n\\in\\omega:X(n)=1\\}&#39;\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X&#39;:=\\{n\\in\\omega:X(n)=1\\}&#39;\\quad(X\\in2^\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\ [A\\equiv_TB\\Rightarrow A&#39;\\equiv_TB&#39;],\\\\\n\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\ \\exists!\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\\n[\\forall A\\in\\mathbf a\\ \\mathbf b=\\deg_T(A&#39;)].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\ [A\\equiv_TB\\Rightarrow A&#39;\\equiv_TB&#39;],\\\\\n\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\ \\exists!\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\\n[\\forall A\\in\\mathbf a\\ \\mathbf b=\\deg_T(A&#39;)].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>代表元不变性由 oracle 模拟得到：把一个 oracle 的查询替换为另一个 oracle 中的固定归约程序，可有效变换停止问题的程序指标；双向归约给跳跃等价。因此所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathbf a\">\\(A\\in\\mathbf a\\)</span> 给出同一个度，原有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\mapsto\\mathbf a\\prime\">\\(\\mathbf a\\mapsto\\mathbf a\\prime\\)</span> 公式无需更换对象。</p>\n<p>集合跳跃是相对对角停机集。度跳跃代表元无关由跳跃单调性保证，证明见 jump。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_T(\\varnothing&#39;)\">\\(\\deg_T(\\varnothing&#39;)\\)</span>，普通 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 可计算互译。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.4.2；印刷页 61；PDF 第 97 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-deg","status":"resolved","id":"c98b19cc764c238f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-deg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolve